# Optional local overrides. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and uncomment what you need.
# Nothing here is required: `npm install && npm run dev` works without this file.
# Everything prefixed VITE_ is baked into the client bundle and readable by every player —
# never put a private key or any other secret here.

# Solana RPC the game reads $MASS balances from (read-only). Default: https://solana-rpc.publicnode.com,
# which serves only plain account reads, so the game checks the wallet's associated token account.
# With a provider of your own the game asks for every token account of the wallet instead.
# Use a browser-safe endpoint (restricted to your domain by the provider), and add its host to the
# title's Blockchain.IframeConnectHosts, or the game embedded on idosgames.com cannot reach it.
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://your-rpc-provider.example

# Reown / WalletConnect project id (dashboard.reown.com). Enables QR and mobile-wallet sign-in;
# without it the game signs in with the wallet extension the browser already has.
# VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# Which copy of the title a production build made on this machine talks to when it is served from
# somewhere other than the title's own addresses: "prod" (live) or "dev" (sandbox).
# VITE_IDOS_ENV=prod
